+
+### User transfer
+
+Moves a user to another organization (group-company moves). Only an org admin of
+`{orgID}` may call it (other orgs → 404, non-admins → 403); the user must currently
+be in `{orgID}` (else 404). `toOrgId` must be a different, existing org (else 400).
+On transfer the user's project memberships and task assignments in the old org are
+removed, and their org-admin flag is cleared.
 
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
